Build on an approved stack. Reuse shared platform capabilities. Keep application code focused on product behavior.

This page explains **which platforms to use**, **where shared SDKs fit**, and **how to start an application reliably**. Use the platform-specific standards for implementation details and the SDK catalog for package names, supported versions, and installation instructions.

<Aside type="tip" title="Platform standard">
Enterprise mobile applications use native Android, native iOS, or React Native. Each application follows its platform's architecture standards and integrates approved shared SDKs for common infrastructure capabilities.
</Aside>

